[b]Onze[/b] is a complete [b]Windows 11 style global theme for KDE Plasma 6[/b] (made for Kubuntu 26.04 / Plasma 6.6), in [b]light[/b] and [b]dark[/b] variants.

[b]What you get[/b]
[list]
[*][b]Centered taskbar[/b] (or on the left, Windows 10 style) with Start, Search, Task View, pinned apps, tray and a compact clock
[*][b]Start menu[/b] in a grid, Windows 11 style
[*][b]Window decorations[/b] with wide buttons, a red "close", rounded corners (top and bottom) and soft shadows
[*][b]Plasma style[/b] with rounded menus and popups, acrylic blur and the Windows 11 task "pill"
[*][b]Fluent color schemes[/b], light and dark
[*][b]Original cursors[/b]: thin white arrow with a 1 px outline
[*][b]Wallpaper[/b] in light and dark versions, up to 3840 px
[*][b]Home folder and Trash[/b] on the desktop, in columns, like Windows
[*]Search, Task View and Show Desktop widgets, in English or Brazilian Portuguese
[/list]

[b]Onze Icons[/b] — an original icon theme drawn for Onze: folders, file types, devices, KDE apps, dialogs and the Start menu's session buttons. 100% original artwork.

[b]Installation[/b] (do not use sudo — everything goes into your user folder)
[code]tar xzf onze-theme-1.4.tar.gz
cd onze-theme-1.4
./install.sh[/code]
The installer asks three questions (light or dark, taskbar centered or on the left, widget language), saves your current settings and applies the theme. Log out and back in to finish. Run [i]./install.sh --help[/i] to see all options (taskbar height, desktop icon size, keep your current panels, and more).

[b]Important:[/b] please install with the included [i]install.sh[/i]. Installing only through "Get New Global Themes" does not set up the icons, cursors, widgets and taskbar layout.

[b]Uninstall[/b]
[code]./uninstall.sh[/code]
It restores the settings you had before the installation.

[b]Notes[/b]
[list]
[*]Works offline: everything is included in the package.
[*]Switch between light and dark at any time in System Settings › Global Theme (Plasma 6.5+ can switch automatically).
[*]The rounded bottom corners come from a thin 4 px window frame; the [url=https://github.com/matinlotfali/KDE-Rounded-Corners]KDE-Rounded-Corners[/url] effect can also round the window contents.
[/list]

Onze is a [b]Projeto Onze[/b] project by Rafael Carvalho Ramos. Theme: GPL-3.0-or-later. Wallpaper: CC0 1.0.
